naming.class
============

The case of the name of a class, an interface, a trait and an enum, which is reported and never renamed.

- `PascalCase`: a capital first and a lowercase letter somewhere, `FooBar`, a name of two letters such as `IO` passing
- `camelCase`: a lowercase letter first, `fooBar`
- `UPPER_CASE`: capitals, digits and underscores, `FOO_BAR`
- `snake_case`: lowercase letters, digits and underscores, `foo_bar`
- `Pascal_Snake_Case`: words joined by underscores, each beginning with a capital, `WP_REST_Request`, a PascalCase name passing too
- `keep`: nothing is enforced, the code stays as it is

Default `keep` · standards: perCs `PascalCase`, psr12 `PascalCase`, nette `PascalCase`, symfony `PascalCase`, laravel `keep` · covers `Squiz.Classes.ValidClassName` .[decision-facts]


naming.method
=============

The case of the name of a method, those beginning with `__` being PHP's, which is reported and never renamed.

- `PascalCase`: a capital first and a lowercase letter somewhere, `FooBar`, a name of two letters such as `IO` passing
- `camelCase`: a lowercase letter first, `fooBar`
- `UPPER_CASE`: capitals, digits and underscores, `FOO_BAR`
- `snake_case`: lowercase letters, digits and underscores, `foo_bar`
- `Pascal_Snake_Case`: words joined by underscores, each beginning with a capital, `WP_REST_Request`, a PascalCase name passing too
- `keep`: nothing is enforced, the code stays as it is

Default `keep` · standards: perCs `camelCase`, psr12 `camelCase`, nette `camelCase`, symfony `camelCase`, laravel `keep` · covers `Generic.NamingConventions.CamelCapsFunctionName`, `PSR1.Methods.CamelCapsMethodName`, `Squiz.NamingConventions.ValidFunctionName` .[decision-facts]


naming.function
===============

The case of the name of a function, those beginning with `__` being PHP's, which is reported and never renamed.

- `PascalCase`: a capital first and a lowercase letter somewhere, `FooBar`, a name of two letters such as `IO` passing
- `camelCase`: a lowercase letter first, `fooBar`
- `UPPER_CASE`: capitals, digits and underscores, `FOO_BAR`
- `snake_case`: lowercase letters, digits and underscores, `foo_bar`
- `Pascal_Snake_Case`: words joined by underscores, each beginning with a capital, `WP_REST_Request`, a PascalCase name passing too
- `keep`: nothing is enforced, the code stays as it is

Default `keep` · standards: perCs `keep`, psr12 `keep`, nette `camelCase`, symfony `keep`, laravel `keep` · covers `Generic.NamingConventions.CamelCapsFunctionName`, `Squiz.NamingConventions.ValidFunctionName` .[decision-facts]


naming.constant
===============

The case of the name of a class constant and a `const` outside a class, a constant of an enum passing in this case or in that of `enumCase`, which is reported and never renamed.

- `PascalCase`: a capital first and a lowercase letter somewhere, `FooBar`, a name of two letters such as `IO` passing
- `camelCase`: a lowercase letter first, `fooBar`
- `UPPER_CASE`: capitals, digits and underscores, `FOO_BAR`
- `snake_case`: lowercase letters, digits and underscores, `foo_bar`
- `Pascal_Snake_Case`: words joined by underscores, each beginning with a capital, `WP_REST_Request`, a PascalCase name passing too
- `keep`: nothing is enforced, the code stays as it is

Default `keep` · standards: perCs `UPPER_CASE`, psr12 `UPPER_CASE`, nette `PascalCase`, symfony `UPPER_CASE`, laravel `keep` · covers `Generic.NamingConventions.UpperCaseConstantName` .[decision-facts]


naming.enumCase
===============

The case of the name of a case of an enum, which is reported and never renamed.

- `PascalCase`: a capital first and a lowercase letter somewhere, `FooBar`, a name of two letters such as `IO` passing
- `camelCase`: a lowercase letter first, `fooBar`
- `UPPER_CASE`: capitals, digits and underscores, `FOO_BAR`
- `snake_case`: lowercase letters, digits and underscores, `foo_bar`
- `Pascal_Snake_Case`: words joined by underscores, each beginning with a capital, `WP_REST_Request`, a PascalCase name passing too
- `keep`: nothing is enforced, the code stays as it is

Default `keep` · standards: perCs `PascalCase`, psr12 `keep`, nette `PascalCase`, symfony `PascalCase`, laravel `keep` .[decision-facts]


naming.property
===============

The case of the name of a property, a promoted constructor parameter included, which is reported and never renamed.

- `PascalCase`: a capital first and a lowercase letter somewhere, `FooBar`, a name of two letters such as `IO` passing
- `camelCase`: a lowercase letter first, `fooBar`
- `UPPER_CASE`: capitals, digits and underscores, `FOO_BAR`
- `snake_case`: lowercase letters, digits and underscores, `foo_bar`
- `Pascal_Snake_Case`: words joined by underscores, each beginning with a capital, `WP_REST_Request`, a PascalCase name passing too
- `keep`: nothing is enforced, the code stays as it is

Default `keep` · standards: perCs `keep`, psr12 `keep`, nette `camelCase`, symfony `keep`, laravel `keep` · covers `Squiz.NamingConventions.ValidVariableName` .[decision-facts]


naming.variable
===============

The case of the name of a variable and a parameter, `$this`, the superglobals and a placeholder such as `$_` excepted, which is reported and never renamed.

- `PascalCase`: a capital first and a lowercase letter somewhere, `FooBar`, a name of two letters such as `IO` passing
- `camelCase`: a lowercase letter first, `fooBar`
- `UPPER_CASE`: capitals, digits and underscores, `FOO_BAR`
- `snake_case`: lowercase letters, digits and underscores, `foo_bar`
- `Pascal_Snake_Case`: words joined by underscores, each beginning with a capital, `WP_REST_Request`, a PascalCase name passing too
- `keep`: nothing is enforced, the code stays as it is

Default `keep` · standards: perCs `keep`, psr12 `keep`, nette `camelCase`, symfony `keep`, laravel `keep` · covers `Squiz.NamingConventions.ValidVariableName` .[decision-facts]


naming.except
=============

The patterns of names never reported, whatever their kind, as the methods of a stream wrapper or a replacement for a native function.

- a list of regular expressions

Default `[]` · standards: perCs `[]`, psr12 `[]`, nette `[]`, symfony `[]`, laravel `[]` .[decision-facts]

```neon
naming:
	method: camelCase
	except:
		- '~^stream_~'
```

```php .[before]
class MemoryStream
{
	public function stream_open(string $path, string $mode): bool
	{
		return true;
	}
}
```
